{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-pg-upperhouse","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"pg-upperhouse-pure-gold-living-jebel-ali-village","about":"PG Upperhouse is an ultra modern project by Pure Gold Living, located in the amazing Jebel Ali Village neighbourhood. The development rises 14 storeys above the city and the luxurious 1-bedroom apartments offer mesmerising views of the picturesque surroundings.The facades and interiors of the complex are designed in a modern style using neutral tones, which gives the grounds and interior of the building an elegant and cosy atmosphere.Residents are presented with a wide range of world-class amenities, including a large infinity pool, children's pool, gym with state-of-the-art equipment, yoga studio, children's playground, electric car charging, as well as walking paths and recreational areas. In the immediate vicinity there is all the infrastructure necessary for life: cafes, restaurants and retail outlets.The complex has a unique strategic location, which allows residents to quickly get to the various attractions of Dubai. Discovery Gardens Metro Station and Ibn Battuta Mall are within walking distance. Ain Dubai Ferris Wheel, Palm Jumeirah, JBR Walk, Dubai Marina and Burj Al Arab are within a 10-15 minute drive, while Downtown Dubai, Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall can be reached within a 20-minute drive.PG Upperhouse is an ideal choice for those seeking a peaceful and relaxed lifestyle in a cosy family community.","price":1065000,"title":"PG Upperhouse","bitrix":{"id":817,"pf_id":"are.2.11936","source":null,"project_id":"PG Upperhouse","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"PG Upperhouse","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Mohammed Bin Rashid City","project_location":"Al Furjan"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1555/images/2024/04/01/340x252/EAw5ZfRqjNY6LQ37nQWCPwOe9OEPEnbwsSh7xdvW.webp","464